## OpenQuok entry (`scheduler/openquok.ts`) — special case

Only update when **OpenQuok product facts** change (pricing tiers, limits, channels):

- Pull plan limits from `openquok-common` (`planLimitsForTier`, etc.) — do not hand-copy prices.
- Channels from `listAvailablePublicChannelCompareLabels()` (every public catalog channel, including coming-soon — no per-channel edit in `openquok.ts`).
- `featureSupport` built dynamically in `buildOpenQuokFeatureSupport()`.
- OpenQuok is `COMPARE_HUB_BASE_SLUG`; it is **not** in `ALTERNATIVES_TARGET_SLUGS` (no duplicate auto hub card). Hub and detail exceptions: **`buildOpenQuokHubEntry`**, **`isAlternativesTargetSlug('openquok')`**, and **`alternativesLongForm`** / OpenQuok-specific detail FAQ on `/alternatives/openquok`.

