## PR checklist

### All competitors

- [ ] `CompareProductSlug`, `categories`, `{slug}.ts`, `PUBLIC_COMPARE_PRODUCTS`, and `COMPARE_PRODUCT_WEBSITE_URLS` updated together.
- [ ] Branded icon added; `icons.{Brand}.name` used in the constant (no string literals).
- [ ] `featureSupport` covers every `PublicPricingCompareRowId` you intend to show (missing rows default to `excluded` on compare detail).
- [ ] `talkingPoints` pairs with OpenQuok (and peers) so with/without sections are not empty.
- [ ] `compareProductIconStyles.ts` `BASE` entry added for the new slug (hub + hero + card rings).
- [ ] User-facing copy on compare/alternatives detail pages is concise ASD-STE100 (short sentences, active voice, `you`).
- [ ] Unit tests updated (`compareProductCategories.test.ts`, `PublicComparePage.presenter.test.ts` when hub/detail wiring changes; optional `{slug}.compareProduct.test.ts` — reference **`boringlaunch.compareProduct.test.ts`** only, not required for every directory peer such as LaunchRepo).
- [ ] `/compare`, `/compare/openquok/{slug}`, `/alternatives`, and `/alternatives/{slug}` smoke-tested (manual and/or presenter tests).
- [ ] No third-party repo paths or attribution in SQL, comments, or user-facing strings (see **source-project-neutrality**).

### Social schedulers (additional)

- [ ] `official_api` verified on the competitor’s site (`included` / `excluded` / `No Info` per table above); PR notes link the source pages (not guesswork).
- [ ] Channel labels match public channel compare labels (`listAvailablePublicChannelCompareLabels()`).

### Directory submission services (additional)

- [ ] `directoryLongForm` block complete; detail page uses `directory_long_form` layout and directory-only compare rows.
- [ ] `official_api` set from evidence (typically **No Info** for managed submission services).
- [ ] OpenQuok directory talking points updated in `scheduler/openquok.ts`.
- [ ] `/compare/openquok/{slug}` and compare hub **Directory submission services** section verified; `/compare/{social}/{directory}` returns 404.
- [ ] Cross-link CTAs point at `/directory-submission-tool` and extension install docs where appropriate.

